The ZXCPM has the TPA address at 6100h.
It is a freeware variant shared in 2003 by Kamil Karimov, derived from the Quorum CP/M


diskdefs configuration for cpmtools 

# ZX 128 + BETADISK (= QUORUM, KLUG etc..)
diskdef quorum
  seclen 1024
  cylinders 80
  sectrk 5
  heads 2
  blocksize 2048
  maxdir 128
  boottrk 4
  os 2.2
end
